# Plan Learning Packs

This is the routing-only planning runtime call for current-code learning. Identify high-value input files and build self-contained evidence packs for their decision-bearing boundaries. The deterministic learning pipeline completes coverage for unassigned inputs; do not spend output on a path-by-path inventory. Do not inspect source bodies or call MCP, CodeGraph, or other repository tools in this planning pass; source-body verification belongs to isolated pack analysis.

